    "why_mse_did_not_reach_zero": "DELTA_WEIGHT=1e-2 was held fixed per the task spec. In guarded_sparse_am_value_update the trust-region term appends a t x t identity block (scaled by sqrt(delta_weight)=0.1) to the stacked design matrix, so even with all 511 slots free the system stays over-determined (n_q + 511 rows vs 511 unknowns) and the achievable MSE is floored by the ||V_S - V_S_old||^2 penalty. RIDGE_LAMBDA=0 does take the lam==0 branch (torch.linalg.lstsq gels) - confirmed by config.yaml ridge_lambda: 0.0."
